  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4a477e63366b02e2",
      "translationZh": "在这篇博客中，我们将探索 Text Generation Inference（TGI）的小兄弟——TGI Benchmarking 工具。它将帮助我们了解如何对 TGI 进行性能剖析，而不只是考察简单的吞吐量，从而更好地理解各种权衡，并决定如何根据自身需求调优部署。如果你曾觉得 LLM 部署成本太高，或者想通过调优部署来提升性能，那么这篇博客就是为你准备的！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f53e3711a21ce851",
      "translationZh": "我将向你展示如何在一个方便易用的 Hugging Face Space 中完成这项工作。你可以将得到的结果应用于 Inference Endpoint，或其他使用相同硬件的实例。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "89b1f4c3df983454",
      "translationZh": "动机",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9dcfdfa6df37488e",
      "translationZh": "为了更好地理解为什么需要进行性能剖析，我们先来讨论一些背景信息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "115dfce8c51b031b",
      "translationZh": "大语言模型（LLMs）从根本上说是低效的。由于解码器的工作方式，生成过程需要为每个解码出的 token 执行一次新的前向传播。随着 LLMs 的规模不断增大，企业中的采用率迅速攀升，AI 行业在开发新的优化方法和性能提升技术方面取得了出色成果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1e2b3431b46a54cf",
      "translationZh": "在 LLM 服务的诸多方面，已经出现了数十项改进。我们看到了 Flash Attention、Paged Attention、流式响应、批处理改进、推测、各种量化方法、Web 服务器改进、采用更快的语言（抱歉了，python 🐍），以及更多其他改进。此外，还有针对使用场景的改进，例如结构化生成和水印，如今也在 LLM 推理领域占据了一席之地。问题在于，要实现快速、高效的方案，需要越来越多的小众专业技能 [1]。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c85db3efde92a967",
      "translationZh": "Text Generation Inference 是 Hugging Face 推出的高性能 LLM 推理服务器，旨在采用并发展最新技术，以改进 LLMs 的部署和使用。得益于 Hugging Face 的开源合作关系，大多数（即使不是全部）主流开源 LLMs 都能在发布当天在 TGI 中使用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5dd0723722272c40",
      "translationZh": "用户的需求往往会因使用场景的要求而大不相同。以 RAG 使用场景中的提示和生成为例：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "25293066c8269b7e",
      "translationZh": "指令/格式设置",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b1f7df7a4d117525",
      "translationZh": "通常较短，<200 个词元",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "02cdb54bbe8da7a4",
      "translationZh": "用户查询",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b1f7df7a4d117525",
      "translationZh": "通常较短，<200 个词元",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0d8338a1e4d9e3a8",
      "translationZh": "多个文档",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ef550675c46de00c",
      "translationZh": "中等长度，每个文档 500-1000 个词元，",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8d4faa4887136b6e",
      "translationZh": "N 个文档，其中 N<10",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "220d726b8b13bc5b",
      "translationZh": "输出中的答案",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e0670c9f5e9f4b13",
      "translationZh": "中等大小，约 500-1000 个词元",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9366c30055f080b5",
      "translationZh": "在 RAG 中，找到合适的文档对于获得高质量回答至关重要；通过增大 N、纳入更多文档，可以提高找到合适文档的概率。这意味着，RAG 通常会尝试用满 LLM 的上下文窗口，以提升任务表现。相比之下，想想基本的聊天场景。典型聊天场景的词元数明显少于 RAG：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "881e5b9991cb760a",
      "translationZh": "多轮对话",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f03a0f628d194880",
      "translationZh": "对于 T 轮对话，词元数为 2xTx50-200",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c69efad2a374c8fe",
      "translationZh": "2x 表示同时计入用户和助手",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ce76f495d98b4be7",
      "translationZh": "鉴于这些场景差异如此之大，我们需要根据哪种场景更符合实际需求，确保对 LLM 服务器进行相应配置。Hugging Face 提供了一款基准测试工具，可以帮助我们探索哪些配置最合理，我将介绍如何在 Hugging Face Space 上进行这项工作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7e21db098160d831",
      "translationZh": "前提条件",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a92a369f74617385",
      "translationZh": "在深入了解这款工具之前，先确保我们对几个关键概念有一致的理解。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "eb5ae7baa40b4138",
      "translationZh": "延迟与吞吐量",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6f3455ad1fb4384d",
      "translationZh": "图 1：延迟与吞吐量可视化",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "11affbc3a343e031",
      "translationZh": "Token 延迟——处理 1 个 token 并将其发送给用户所需的时间",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3ec9bc7d2d1b642c",
      "translationZh": "请求延迟——完整响应一个请求所需的时间",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c3216725db827d63",
      "translationZh": "首个 Token 返回时间——从发起请求到首个 token 返回给用户所需的时间。这包括处理预填充输入的时间，以及生成单个 token 的时间",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "39b92039c0f9da0f",
      "translationZh": "吞吐量——服务器在一定时间内能够返回的 token 数量（本例中为每秒 4 个 token）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "80dcb2d455d3bb9d",
      "translationZh": "延迟是一项难以准确解读的指标，因为它无法反映全貌。生成过程可能很长，也可能很短，但这并不能充分说明服务器的实际性能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3e58120258013b23",
      "translationZh": "重要的是，要理解吞吐量和延迟是相互独立的衡量指标；根据服务器的配置方式，我们可以针对其中一项进行优化。我们的基准测试工具将通过数据可视化，帮助我们理解两者之间的权衡。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ad3e98056b0f25a3",
      "translationZh": "预填充与解码",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "70959c37e15f61bd",
      "translationZh": "图 2：预填充与解码对比，灵感来自 [2]",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2907e63e1a754d0f",
      "translationZh": "下面简要说明 LLM 如何生成文本。模型（通常）在每次前向传播中生成一个词元。在橙色的预填充阶段，完整的提示（美国的……是什么？）被发送给模型，并生成一个词元（华盛顿）。在蓝色的解码阶段，生成的词元被追加到之前的输入中，然后将这个输入（……美国的首都？华盛顿）送入模型，再进行一次前向传播。在模型生成序列结束词元（<EOS>）之前，这个过程会不断重复：将输入送入模型，生成一个词元，将该词元追加到输入中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d4a013f73ff28cfc",
      "translationZh": "思考题：当我们提交多个模型尚未见过的词元作为输入时，为什么预填充只需要进行 1 次前向传播？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "38ab42cb792200ac",
      "translationZh": "点击查看答案 我们不需要生成“What is the”后面的内容。根据用户的输入，我们知道后面是“capital”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4551781e1bc5a839",
      "translationZh": "我只用了一个简短的示例来说明，但请注意，预填充只需要让输入经过模型进行 1 次前向传播，而解码可能需要数百次甚至更多。即使在这个简短的示例中，我们也能看到蓝色箭头比橙色箭头多。现在我们明白为什么从 LLM 获取输出需要这么长时间了！由于需要多次前向传播，解码通常是我们花更多时间思考优化的环节。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "38e8d1abe2d537e5",
      "translationZh": "基准测试工具",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "89b1f4c3df983454",
      "translationZh": "动机",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1e9f22785f1ec14a",
      "translationZh": "我们都见过展示吞吐量的工具、新算法或模型对比。虽然这是 LLM 推理的重要一环，但其中缺少一些关键信息。至少（当然，你可以更深入地研究），我们需要同时知道吞吐量和延迟，才能做出明智的决策。TGI 基准测试工具的主要优势之一，就是具备这种能力。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "da19409d8676ff51",
      "translationZh": "另一个重要的思考方向是，你希望用户获得怎样的体验。你更在意为大量用户提供服务，还是希望每个用户一旦开始使用你的系统，就能得到快速响应？你希望有更短的首个 token 到达时间（Time To First Token，TTFT），还是希望用户收到首个 token 后，后续 token 能以极快的速度出现，即使首个 token 会有所延迟？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6d1332c1c8099e0a",
      "translationZh": "下面是一些关于这些取舍在实际中如何体现的思路。记住，天下没有免费的午餐。不过，只要有足够的 GPU 和合适的配置，你几乎可以享用任何想要的餐点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4dcf976f3d271af6",
      "translationZh": "我在意的是……",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "81802dd6fa49157f",
      "translationZh": "我应该重点关注……",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7cdf1958245e370f",
      "translationZh": "服务更多用户",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1cc6043aab089874",
      "translationZh": "最大化吞吐量",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7343718c895ca7c8",
      "translationZh": "用户不会离开我的页面/应用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "420b81361a82afab",
      "translationZh": "尽可能缩短 TTFT",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a4ffc37de7ca7b3d",
      "translationZh": "中等用户数量下的用户体验",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dc631f556a4a4973",
      "translationZh": "尽可能降低延迟",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5f50b6122139f823",
      "translationZh": "全面均衡的体验",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "202a3fec665fe74d",
      "translationZh": "限制延迟上限并最大化吞吐量",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7013af4c42fe4380",
      "translationZh": "设置",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5212b2fa2a611a91",
      "translationZh": "基准测试工具随 TGI 一同安装，但你需要能够访问服务器才能运行它。考虑到这一点，我提供了 derek-thomas/tgi-benchmark-space 这个空间，将 TGI docker 镜像（固定使用 latest）与 jupyter lab 工作空间结合起来。它是供你复制使用的，因此如果它处于休眠状态，也不必担心。它让我们能够部署自己选择的模型，并通过 CLI 轻松运行基准测试工具。我添加了一些笔记本，方便你跟着操作。欢迎深入查看 Dockerfile，了解它的构建方式，尤其是当你想对它进行调整时。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d00eca1bae674280",
      "translationZh": "入门",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "039a40d03caf93c8",
      "translationZh": "请注意，由于基准测试工具具有交互性，在 jupyter lab 终端中运行它要比在 notebook 中运行好得多。不过，我会将命令放在 notebook 中，这样我就可以添加注释，你也能轻松跟着操作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8bba615794a4cf2a",
      "translationZh": "点击：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "41aac2cbc7d7eaa0",
